{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyoko.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "事务所里有个眼熟的女孩子",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyoko.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyoko.first",
    "idolId": "chiyoko",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（今天从进事务所的孩子里挑……就是上次甄选通过的那几个吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯？那个扎两个小丸子的女孩子……好像一直在看我。）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "……啊！那位是！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "那个，您还记得我吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶、那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（这个孩子，我有印象……对了！）是参加甄选的園田智代子小姐吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "是！没错！您还记得我，我好高兴！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "那时候真的受您照顾了……！非常感谢！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我今后会努力的。……虽说离出道还远得很……诶嘿嘿。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（園田小姐的笑容……朴素，但非常可爱。这份亲和力一定会成为武器。）",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……園田小姐，如果可以的话，要不要来我带的组合？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "诶诶！？我吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看到園田小姐的笑容，我就觉得无论如何都想邀请你。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可能有点突然，你觉得呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "可、可是可是，真的让我来可以吗？我完全就是个普通人……！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没有『普通』这回事。把你有的东西用起来就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我有的东西……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "能跟我说说你的事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我知道了！那个，那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我是園田智代子，女高中生，朋友都叫我チョコ，",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "チョコ？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "是！名字是智代子，能读成チョコ，所以就有了这个外号……嗯？チョコ……？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "チョコアイドル，園田智代子！……您觉得怎么样？！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我喜欢甜食，感觉特别合适！",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。不错啊，巧克力偶像！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "真的吗！？好开心！为了配得上巧克力偶像，我会努力的！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "毕竟是板巧克力嘛！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "板、板巧克力？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "是！我想着，如果能说这种和巧克力挂上钩的台词，就很有巧克力偶像的感觉……！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "好——！既然决定了，我会想很多很多的！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
